vectorops.__version__ → 0.1.0
pip download --index-url http://localhost:8080/simple --no-deps -d /tmp/vops-dl vectorops==0.1.0 → succeeded
```
The log's `GET /simple/pip/ 404` lines are only pip checking whether it is itself upgradable on that index — expected, harmless.

